{"ABSOLUTE_SOURCE_PATH_EXPOSED_BY_API":false,"case_id":"g8ctxr101","case_type":"pronoun_reference","corpus_id":"870e5864df67","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["证据","检索","生成"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["证据","检索","生成"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"最终回答错误不能直接归因于模型能力，因为 RAG 至少包含三个可独立失败的部分：数据/索引、检索、生成。即使最终答案错误，也可能是证据没有入库、检索未召回、Rerank 排掉、Prompt 中未包含，或模型忽略/误读证据等原因，而不仅仅是模型能力问题。[C2]","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":3933.7,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"causal"},"route":{"reason_code":"CAUSAL_SYNTHESIS","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"25e2df224eda743869bc2c257c487824","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":1,"score":13.6615,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"eada04f5d3fd3e8fbd6328313296bde5","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":2,"score":9.555,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"7550e266e76533bb89d5469722c80d2e","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"a2fa4c500d30389c","rank":2,"score":10.4474,"source":"finetuning/微调方法.md"},{"chunk_id":"9b79c5aa0fe76fb640c3c2cc156ca9ac","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"da36e8e873bef694","rank":3,"score":9.5483,"source":"post_training/后训练-07-简历项目与面试高频题.md"},{"chunk_id":"542761507c0d1f99eb7944cff41db3c0","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"4a946d6ac3c8c2b2","rank":4,"score":9.2684,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-04-状态部署与测试.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0},"schema_version":"gate8_context_result_r1","turn1":"高级 RAG 评测中，判断最终答案错误前需要检查哪些环节？","turn1_result":{"answer":"根据 [C1]，判断最终答案错误前需要依次检查以下环节：\n\n1. 标准证据是否在索引里；\n2. Top-K 是否召回；\n3. Rerank 是否把它排掉；\n4. 最终 Prompt 是否包含它；\n5. 模型是否忽略、误读或错误综合；\n6. 引用是否正确。\n\n这些步骤用于定位失败发生在数据/索引、检索还是生成阶段。[C1]","latency_ms":4923.83,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"eada04f5d3fd3e8fbd6328313296bde5","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":1,"score":20.5719,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"25e2df224eda743869bc2c257c487824","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":1,"score":15.4098,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"efecdb07a2fe6d907698c93672a4f9d7","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"5fcddd69127d9078","rank":3,"score":12.1086,"source":"prompt/评估与优化.md"},{"chunk_id":"a63be3bba978a7120a745caeefc64429","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":2,"score":16.0219,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"11cba9e8948037be48509c9255fb4985","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"50d6f867cf7f44ac","rank":2,"score":13.2011,"source":"llm/对齐与微调.md"}],"status":"completed"},"turn1_valid":true,"turn2":"它为什么不能直接归因于模型能力？","with_history":{"answer":"不能直接将错误归因于模型能力，因为 RAG 至少包含三个可独立失败的部分：数据/索引、检索、生成 [C1]。如果最终回答错误，必须先按顺序检查：标准证据是否在索引里、Top-K 是否召回、Rerank 是否将其排掉、最终 Prompt 是否包含该证据、模型是否忽略/误读/错误综合、引用是否正确 [C1]。只有完成这些排查，才能定位真正失败的模块，否则修改模型或提示词可能无法解决问题 [C1]。","context":{"history_messages_received":2,"history_messages_used":2,"history_tokens_used":165,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":true},"latency_ms":5322.56,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"causal"},"route":{"reason_code":"CAUSAL_SYNTHESIS","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"eada04f5d3fd3e8fbd6328313296bde5","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":1,"score":38.3698,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"e91b6cd5dcc60bae4503ee877378e269","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"da36e8e873bef694","rank":1,"score":19.3378,"source":"post_training/后训练-07-简历项目与面试高频题.md"},{"chunk_id":"9cddac7ac37f79f19ef6904301b69a28","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":2,"score":32.2208,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"},{"chunk_id":"7f0e0301d9690995d01e2857371c369f","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"076bfdb158a7f47a","rank":3,"score":18.0791,"source":"rag/检索与生成.md"},{"chunk_id":"381c5fd35181a62e613a5c73cc87e8da","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"b9ed7f314b155cbc","rank":3,"score":28.6616,"source":"rag/高级RAG.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0}}
{"ABSOLUTE_SOURCE_PATH_EXPOSED_BY_API":false,"case_id":"g8ctxr102","case_type":"plural_reference","corpus_id":"870e5864df67","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":false,"follow_up_understanding":false,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":[],"retrieval_relevance":false,"status":"FAIL","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["向量","索引","相似度","检索"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"无法计算。","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":1501.47,"planner":{"action":"no_retrieval","query_type":"unanswerable_or_no_retrieval"},"route":{"reason_code":"NO_RETRIEVAL_NEEDED","retrieval_strategy":"none","route":"direct_answer"},"sources":[],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":0,"reason_code":"NOT_REQUIRED","status":"not_required"},"warning_count":0},"schema_version":"gate8_context_result_r1","turn1":"向量数据库中的向量索引和相似度检索分别解决什么问题？","turn1_result":{"answer":"向量索引解决的是**在大规模数据下高效检索候选向量**的问题：通过聚类分桶（如 IVF）、量化压缩（如 PQ）等结构，避免全量逐一计算，在召回率与延迟之间取折中，并支持调整参数（如 nprobe）来控制扫描范围 [C1][C3]。精确检索虽然能给出准确 Top-K，但数据量大时计算和内存访问昂贵，因此需要 ANN 索引来加速 [C3]。\n\n相似度检索解决的是**如何量化向量之间相似程度并据此返回排序结果**的问题：通过余弦相似度、内积或欧氏距离等度量计算查询与向量的相似性/距离，其选择要与 Embedding 模型、归一化方式及数据库支持的 metric 保持一致 [C2]。","latency_ms":8970.86,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"bea3f8a32ef45bdc5f3d59f046830717","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"263a596a15bde15e","rank":1,"score":17.4472,"source":"vector_db/核心概念.md"},{"chunk_id":"f95ac89884c9ac70f70a59a83d31b69b","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"263a596a15bde15e","rank":1,"score":18.3148,"source":"vector_db/核心概念.md"},{"chunk_id":"9a284d8ccf4aecf21597730549a4a1f2","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"58900e3c6745e029","rank":2,"score":17.4319,"source":"vector_db/产品对比.md"},{"chunk_id":"3786baffca55445ea949553be5cb0530","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"d53277e8d1dce368","rank":2,"score":17.9846,"source":"rag/文档处理.md"},{"chunk_id":"c5f7f9a41b365b3516eb1a965b5e1915","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"58900e3c6745e029","rank":3,"score":15.2671,"source":"vector_db/产品对比.md"}],"status":"completed"},"turn1_valid":true,"turn2":"它们在查询流程中分别承担什么作用？","with_history":{"answer":"基于现有资料，向量索引在查询时用于缩小搜索范围，例如 IVF 会先找最近的聚类中心，只扫描对应 lists 中的向量 [C1]；相似度检索则对候选向量计算相似度（如余弦、内积）进行排序，且当向量做 L2 归一化后，余弦相似度与内积排序等价 [C4]。但参考资料未系统区分二者在查询流程中的完整分工，现有资料不足。缺失的信息点包括：索引与相似度计算在查询流水线中的具体先后关系和各自优化目标、不同索引（如 HNSW/PQ）下的相似度计算细节等。","context":{"history_messages_received":2,"history_messages_used":2,"history_tokens_used":298,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":true},"latency_ms":9368.95,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"comparison"},"route":{"reason_code":"COMPARISON_EVIDENCE","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"bea3f8a32ef45bdc5f3d59f046830717","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"263a596a15bde15e","rank":1,"score":15.096,"source":"vector_db/核心概念.md"},{"chunk_id":"abf9618fe5c04bc64b8ebe4a3c98b073","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"d53277e8d1dce368","rank":1,"score":16.7352,"source":"rag/文档处理.md"},{"chunk_id":"e1232c01790e7c3330d612e2d9a02102","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"58900e3c6745e029","rank":2,"score":14.1895,"source":"vector_db/产品对比.md"},{"chunk_id":"3786baffca55445ea949553be5cb0530","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"d53277e8d1dce368","rank":2,"score":15.3663,"source":"rag/文档处理.md"},{"chunk_id":"9b4cc8333fa0fb0e7c78e3f28086624b","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"58900e3c6745e029","rank":3,"score":13.1054,"source":"vector_db/产品对比.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0}}
{"ABSOLUTE_SOURCE_PATH_EXPOSED_BY_API":false,"case_id":"g8ctxr103","case_type":"previous_concept_reference","corpus_id":"870e5864df67","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["能力","发现","传输"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["能力","发现","传输"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"现有资料不足。参考资料 [C3] 仅分别描述了“能力发现与调用”流程（如 Client 调用 `list tools`，Server 返回名称、描述、input schema 等）和“传输方式”（stdio 与 Streamable HTTP），但没有解释为什么需要将能力发现与传输机制区分开。缺失的信息点包括：区分两者的设计动机、能力发现层与传输层各自的职责边界、以及在什么场景下必须独立设计能力发现机制。","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":7374.3,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"causal"},"route":{"reason_code":"CAUSAL_SYNTHESIS","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"2140dd51eda6448ef5124b60ebbd170c","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"28e6ff0adda24105","rank":1,"score":7.2266,"source":"deployment/量化技术.md"},{"chunk_id":"6b971daa384e4970ddd42cdd6086ce94","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"0b8e7ace8c50caec","rank":2,"score":4.8798,"source":"finetuning/数据工程.md"},{"chunk_id":"3f88a73411fc2c440c67e85e8ab0f943","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"734e6444e5bb3ba0","rank":1,"score":9.6337,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-02-能力发现与传输.md"},{"chunk_id":"935fa3af2960a06112de48d302dddae3","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"3c11a591e8c2d851","rank":2,"score":6.6175,"source":"finetuning/训练与评估.md"},{"chunk_id":"ac58dbe4325e7601917a356ae2a193fe","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"0b8e7ace8c50caec","rank":3,"score":4.6356,"source":"finetuning/数据工程.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0},"schema_version":"gate8_context_result_r1","turn1":"MCP 的能力发现和传输分别是什么？","turn1_result":{"answer":"MCP 的能力发现指：Client 通过 `list tools` 向 Server 请求工具列表，Server 返回工具的名称、描述和 input schema；随后 Host 选择允许暴露给模型的工具，模型生成调用，Host 与 Server 分别校验后执行 [C5]。初始化完成后还要发现 tools/resources/prompts [C4]。工具列表可能变化时，Client 需处理能力变化通知或重新发现，不能永久缓存旧 Schema [C5]。\n\nMCP 的传输方式主要有两种：stdio 和 Streamable HTTP。stdio 由 Host 启动本地 Server 子进程，通过标准输入/输出传输协议消息，优点是不开放网络端口、进程生命周期由 Host 管理；注意 stdout 只能输出协议消息，普通日志写 stderr [C5]。Streamable HTTP 适合远程或独立部署的 Server，需处理 TLS、身份认证与授权、Session/连接状态、反向代理超时与流式转发、Origin/Host 校验、CSRF/SSRF 相关边界等 [C5]。","latency_ms":3841.4,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"542761507c0d1f99eb7944cff41db3c0","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"4a946d6ac3c8c2b2","rank":1,"score":16.7609,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-04-状态部署与测试.md"},{"chunk_id":"8cf641b03d0de719507b583f00a5a9a0","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"b6f50ed000b39bca","rank":2,"score":16.0456,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-01-基础与原语.md"},{"chunk_id":"b0fa276766b65ade22f899af29c2048d","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"aa5acc7935a8deeb","rank":3,"score":15.9663,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-03-结果设计与安全边界.md"},{"chunk_id":"02126a9261d82bf7e77a26d37ae13679","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"b6f50ed000b39bca","rank":4,"score":13.0929,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-01-基础与原语.md"},{"chunk_id":"3f88a73411fc2c440c67e85e8ab0f943","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"734e6444e5bb3ba0","rank":5,"score":12.3894,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-02-能力发现与传输.md"}],"status":"completed"},"turn1_valid":true,"turn2":"这种机制为什么需要区分能力发现和传输？","with_history":{"answer":"MCP 需要区分能力发现与传输，是因为两者解决不同层面的问题：\n\n- **能力发现**负责“有什么能力、如何描述、如何调用”：Client 通过 `list tools` 获取工具的名称、描述和 input schema，并处理工具列表变化时的重新发现，不能永久缓存旧 Schema（[C3]）。\n- **传输**负责“消息如何在 Client 与 Server 间传递”：stdio 适合本地子进程，Streamable HTTP 适合远程部署，两者在安全性、运维和部署场景上有不同要求（[C3]）。\n\n将二者解耦，才能使同一个 MCP Server 被不同 Host 通过不同传输方式复用（[C1]），同时保证能力发现机制不依赖具体传输通道，从而在工具变更时灵活更新（[C3]）。","context":{"history_messages_received":2,"history_messages_used":2,"history_tokens_used":317,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":true},"latency_ms":8661.96,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"causal"},"route":{"reason_code":"CAUSAL_SYNTHESIS","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"8cf641b03d0de719507b583f00a5a9a0","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"b6f50ed000b39bca","rank":1,"score":12.5624,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-01-基础与原语.md"},{"chunk_id":"b0fa276766b65ade22f899af29c2048d","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"aa5acc7935a8deeb","rank":1,"score":11.1791,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-03-结果设计与安全边界.md"},{"chunk_id":"3f88a73411fc2c440c67e85e8ab0f943","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"734e6444e5bb3ba0","rank":3,"score":12.647,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-02-能力发现与传输.md"},{"chunk_id":"e2156104fd4d95a4bdc026a1c3a66ac9","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"35e9d3b9f9f24da5","rank":3,"score":11.0746,"source":"llm/Transformer架构-04-采样与工程联系.md"},{"chunk_id":"542761507c0d1f99eb7944cff41db3c0","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"4a946d6ac3c8c2b2","rank":4,"score":8.9148,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-04-状态部署与测试.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0}}
