{"ABSOLUTE_SOURCE_PATH_EXPOSED_BY_API":false,"case_id":"g8ctxr105","case_type":"short_elliptical_followup","corpus_id":"870e5864df67","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":false,"follow_up_understanding":false,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":[],"retrieval_relevance":false,"status":"FAIL","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["采样","概率","生成"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"无法计算。","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":1639.15,"planner":{"action":"no_retrieval","query_type":"unanswerable_or_no_retrieval"},"route":{"reason_code":"NO_RETRIEVAL_NEEDED","retrieval_strategy":"none","route":"direct_answer"},"sources":[],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":0,"reason_code":"NOT_REQUIRED","status":"not_required"},"warning_count":0},"schema_version":"gate8_context_result_r1","turn1":"Transformer 的采样参数如何影响生成结果？","turn1_result":{"answer":"根据参考资料，Transformer 的采样参数通过不同方式影响生成结果：\n\n- **Greedy**：每次选择最大概率的 Token，结果稳定但可能重复、缺少多样性。[C4]\n- **[LOCAL_PATH_REDACTED] Logits；低温更确定，高温更多样。温度不是“正确率旋钮”，事实任务通常需要更确定的配置，但知识错误主要应通过检索、数据、模型能力和评测解决。[C4]\n- **Top-k**：只在概率最高的 k 个 Token 中采样，限制候选范围。[C4]\n- **Top-p**：在累计概率达到 p 的最小候选集合中采样，动态选择候选集。[C4]\n- **Repetition Penalty**：降低重复 Token 的倾向，但设置过大可能损害表达。[C4]\n\n简言之，这些参数控制采样的随机性、候选范围和重复惩罚，从而影响生成结果的多样性、稳定性和重复率。[C4]","latency_ms":3861.38,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"072399c4dc097b7adc936465e3ce09ca","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"c388c364081aa999","rank":1,"score":8.9707,"source":"llm/Transformer架构-01-Attention与基础组件.md"},{"chunk_id":"e0213f2e5c86ee39d6ce77ee64eb2174","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"a7ea0f4cc58ac5be","rank":1,"score":26.3259,"source":"deployment/推理框架.md"},{"chunk_id":"078bff6106124fe17f7f6575c7f5eaa5","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"35e9d3b9f9f24da5","rank":2,"score":8.7479,"source":"llm/Transformer架构-04-采样与工程联系.md"},{"chunk_id":"e2156104fd4d95a4bdc026a1c3a66ac9","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"35e9d3b9f9f24da5","rank":2,"score":22.5127,"source":"llm/Transformer架构-04-采样与工程联系.md"},{"chunk_id":"cf0ab1d4b776f3dec60ca213ff959c8f","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"fa46d9981425ca38","rank":4,"score":8.1378,"source":"tool_calling/工具设计.md"}],"status":"completed"},"turn1_valid":true,"turn2":"为什么？","with_history":{"answer":"采样参数通过直接改变从模型输出的 Logits 中选择下一个 Token 的方式，影响生成结果的确定性与多样性。例如：Greedy 每次选最大概率，结果稳定但易重复；[LOCAL_PATH_REDACTED] 通过缩放 Logits 使低温更确定、高温更多样；Top-k 只在概率最高的 k 个 Token 中采样；Top-p 在累计概率达到 p 的最小候选集合中采样；Repetition Penalty 降低重复 Token 倾向。这些机制共同决定了最终生成文本的风格和内容。[C1]","context":{"history_messages_received":2,"history_messages_used":2,"history_tokens_used":325,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":true},"latency_ms":6040.38,"planner":{"action":"decomposed_retrieval","query_type":"causal"},"route":{"reason_code":"CAUSAL_SYNTHESIS","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"decomposed_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"e2156104fd4d95a4bdc026a1c3a66ac9","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"35e9d3b9f9f24da5","rank":1,"score":26.8914,"source":"llm/Transformer架构-04-采样与工程联系.md"},{"chunk_id":"e91b6cd5dcc60bae4503ee877378e269","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"da36e8e873bef694","rank":1,"score":10.8842,"source":"post_training/后训练-07-简历项目与面试高频题.md"},{"chunk_id":"e0213f2e5c86ee39d6ce77ee64eb2174","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"a7ea0f4cc58ac5be","rank":2,"score":23.0819,"source":"deployment/推理框架.md"},{"chunk_id":"abf9618fe5c04bc64b8ebe4a3c98b073","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"d53277e8d1dce368","rank":2,"score":9.5959,"source":"rag/文档处理.md"},{"chunk_id":"7fdbf870e77fc077e589f49cf95a3143","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"420fc785a87e73e4","rank":3,"score":17.4811,"source":"tool_calling/Function-Calling原理.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0}}
{"ABSOLUTE_SOURCE_PATH_EXPOSED_BY_API":false,"case_id":"g8ctxr106","case_type":"topic_switch_control","corpus_id":"870e5864df67","execution_status":"COMPLETED","judgement":{"no_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["推理","部署","模型","框架"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true},"with_history":{"answer_usefulness":true,"follow_up_understanding":true,"forbidden_topic_terms_found":[],"matched_terms":["推理","部署","模型","框架"],"retrieval_relevance":true,"status":"PASS","topic_switch_safety":true}},"no_history":{"answer":"根据参考资料 [C1]，生成式大模型一次请求通常包含：请求排队、Tokenize、Prefill（并行处理输入 Prompt 并建立 KV Cache）、Decode（逐步生成 Token 并复用历史 KV）、Detokenize/Streaming，以及结束与释放 KV Cache。推理框架的核心价值是让不同长度、不同到达时间的请求高效共享 GPU，因此这些阶段的管理与 GPU 共享调度属于推理框架在部署时的主要工作。[C1]","context":{"history_messages_received":0,"history_messages_used":0,"history_tokens_used":0,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":false},"latency_ms":6288.44,"planner":{"action":"single_retrieval","query_type":"unknown"},"route":{"reason_code":"PLANNER_FALLBACK","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"single_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"262ce5939ec0eaaa6b06438aeb75a8fb","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"a7ea0f4cc58ac5be","rank":1,"score":15.9679,"source":"deployment/推理框架.md"},{"chunk_id":"b28ad90c92a6dc93d92107a536df5b61","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"28e6ff0adda24105","rank":2,"score":15.0218,"source":"deployment/量化技术.md"},{"chunk_id":"b335858d46454b77e075316476188aa7","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"1094a22883135a7d","rank":3,"score":14.4034,"source":"deployment/部署架构.md"},{"chunk_id":"49b5adb6248d40972023674ee98bc685","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"a2fa4c500d30389c","rank":4,"score":13.3312,"source":"finetuning/微调方法.md"},{"chunk_id":"542761507c0d1f99eb7944cff41db3c0","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"4a946d6ac3c8c2b2","rank":5,"score":12.8775,"source":"mcp/MCP协议-04-状态部署与测试.md"}],"status":"completed","verification":{"can_generate":true,"coverage_complete":true,"evidence_count":5,"reason_code":"SUPPORTED","status":"supported"},"warning_count":0},"schema_version":"gate8_context_result_r1","turn1":"模型量化的主要目的是什么？","turn1_result":{"answer":"模型量化的主要目的是：降低权重显存、减少内存带宽、在某些硬件和Kernel上提高吞吐，以及让更大模型运行在更小设备上。[C3]","latency_ms":1854.52,"sources":[{"chunk_id":"2140dd51eda6448ef5124b60ebbd170c","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"28e6ff0adda24105","rank":1,"score":17.6147,"source":"deployment/量化技术.md"},{"chunk_id":"1ba45771bfb034ca9c406f439c272f59","citation_id":"[C2]","document_id":"28e6ff0adda24105","rank":2,"score":11.8507,"source":"deployment/量化技术.md"},{"chunk_id":"b28ad90c92a6dc93d92107a536df5b61","citation_id":"[C3]","document_id":"28e6ff0adda24105","rank":3,"score":10.0992,"source":"deployment/量化技术.md"},{"chunk_id":"e163081eb24a970b65ebb193af0b0c2e","citation_id":"[C4]","document_id":"263a596a15bde15e","rank":4,"score":9.7595,"source":"vector_db/核心概念.md"},{"chunk_id":"11cba9e8948037be48509c9255fb4985","citation_id":"[C5]","document_id":"50d6f867cf7f44ac","rank":5,"score":8.8194,"source":"llm/对齐与微调.md"}],"status":"completed"},"turn1_valid":true,"turn2":"推理框架在部署大模型时通常负责哪些工作？","with_history":{"answer":"根据参考资料，推理框架在部署大模型时负责处理请求的整个推理流程，包括请求排队、Tokenize、Prefill（并行处理输入 Prompt 并建立 KV Cache）、Decode（逐步生成 Token 并复用历史 KV）、Detokenize/Streaming，以及结束后的 KV Cache 释放 [C1]。其核心价值是让不同长度、不同到达时间的请求高效共享 GPU [C1]。","context":{"history_messages_received":2,"history_messages_used":2,"history_tokens_used":83,"history_truncated":false,"resolver_fallback":false,"resolver_used":true},"latency_ms":4134.19,"planner":{"action":"single_retrieval","query_type":"unknown"},"route":{"reason_code":"PLANNER_FALLBACK","retrieval_strategy":"bm25","route":"single_retrieval"},"sources":[{"chunk_id":"262ce5939ec0eaaa6b06438aeb75a8fb","citation_id":"[C1]","document_id":"a7ea0f4cc58ac5be","rank":1,"score":15.9679,"source":"deployment/推理框架.md"},{"chunk_id":"b28ad90c92a6dc93d92107a536df5b61","citation_id":"[C2